
### 4. HTTPBearer vs OAuth2PasswordBearer
- OAuth2PasswordBearer — adds complex OAuth2 form to Swagger docs
- HTTPBearer — simpler, just a token text box
- We switched from OAuth2 to HTTPBearer for cleaner /docs

### 5. Pydantic Schemas for Validation

| Schema | Purpose | Fields |
|--------|---------|--------|
| UserCreate | Signup input | username, email, password |
| UserLogin | Login input | username, password |
| UserResponse | User output (no password!) | id, username, email, role, is_active, created_at |
| Token | Login output | access_token, token_type |

Schemas act as contracts — they validate incoming data and format outgoing data.

