## Key Concepts

| Concept | Meaning |
|---------|---------|
| Hashing | One-way scrambling — can't reverse |
| bcrypt | Industry standard hashing algorithm |
| JWT | Digital wristband — proves identity |
| Bearer token | Token format: `Bearer eyJ...` |
| Protected route | Endpoint requiring authentication |
| Dependency injection | `Depends(get_current_user)` — FastAPI auto-injects user |
| 401 Unauthorized | Missing or invalid token |
| 201 Created | Successful resource creation |

